	(text "Notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ab02960-d1d1-5f9d-81f5-5e5b6e658bd1")
	)
	(text "1. Board power enters on header pins 2 and 4 (PI_5V).\n2. PI_3V3 feeds only the host-side buffers U6-U9 and U28; the safety domain runs\n   from its own SAFE_3V3.\n3. GPIO18 heartbeat (HOST_HEARTBEAT) and GPIO19 servo request (SERVO_REQUEST)\n   belong to the safety interface.\n4. GPIO26 (MOTOR_EN) only requests actuator power; the hardware gates on\n   sheet 4 (Independent safety supervisor) decide.\n5. GPIO20 (HOST_FAULT) HIGH = healthy; GPIO21 (HOST_ARMED) HIGH = motors armed.\n6. GPIO0, GPIO1 and GPIO7 carry SWD and reset while SW5 is at PROG; the host keeps\n   SPI0 and the ID EEPROM probe disabled.\n7. GPIO14 and GPIO15 (UART) are not connected.\n8. The host mounts inverted on PI1 (pin 1 inward)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ba37c80f-a451-5b3c-b19c-c0e1fd79ec07")
	)
	(text "Sheet 2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
