	(text "1. Sheets connect through global labels and power symbols; the sheet symbols carry no pins. Arrows on this page name the main\n   nets between sheets.\n2. A global label's shape gives the signal direction seen from its sheet; rectangular labels are passive."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 258.45 0)
		(effects
