		(uuid "8bcf32c0-963e-5c0a-8413-87aa0b037e3d")
	)
	(text "3. Values name the fitted part; the MPN, Manufacturer and Selected_rating fields give the full specification.\n4. Parts drawn crossed out carry the DNP attribute and are not fitted."
