		(property "Design_note" "Samtec SSW dual-row PTH female socket, lead style -01 (tail 2.64 mm: ~1.0 mm protrusion below the 1.6 mm board; -02 would stick out 3.3 mm): selected 1.04mm drill. Inverted Pi assembly: pin1 inward/east, pin2 outward/west. 19.5 mm stack; 3D fit: no collisions, closest part under the Pi 6.4 mm away."
